{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b3d4d45e45643474011d09cd20db41de3daaf4b1ebf66829a12355b32605179c","ja":"お互いの気持ち","zh":"彼此的心意","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4e31def68a7193744805d309380a8e6507f13812d13ed0d708a393b084a4d349","ja":"ど、どうして紬ちゃんが謝るの？","zh":"怎、怎么会是小紬道歉呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c52e573faf992b1bf19a90f902e442816c4b678deeb2537ac96b1dca53fd7110","ja":"それは……。今日はなかなか思うようにできずに、\nみなさんにご迷惑をお掛けしてしまったので。","zh":"那是因为……今天我总做不好，\n给大家添了不少麻烦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"db9b737490f7c1f4b3986fa1067388b6bd6347bdfda7457a083b0aed1f2f3c68","ja":"その、桜守さんみたいにエレガントにせんとって\n考えたら、いつもにも増して緊張してしまって……。","zh":"那个，一想到必须像樱守小姐那样优雅，\n就比平时更加紧张了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"092331774d54e29d202d2318625ebefe58ddf9b79c3216340412227a01438bc8","ja":"そんなこと……だって、すごく落ち着いて見えたし、\nひとつひとつの所作も綺麗だったわよ。","zh":"没那回事……你看上去明明非常从容，\n而且一举一动也都非常优美呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"77120602c2495d523e885a96f5704a61a4f19bc38430fa3a76718efa371dff06","ja":"藤の花の下での撮影なんて本当に素敵で、\nスタッフさんからも、すごく褒められてたじゃない。","zh":"在紫藤花下的拍摄真的很棒，\n工作人员也把你夸得不行呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"707045cc010788bb010352cd8b679d7bed298369f58bba02d0e95d831424193e","ja":"えっ、あれは本当に褒めていただいていたの\nですか！？　私はてっきり、お世辞かと……。","zh":"欸，当时您真的是在夸奖我\n吗！？我还以为那只是客套话……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9c4f1d32e115b5db47affd581a5d152de44e5f3c6097813227d74b82627a8b37","ja":"……うふふっ♪　まさか、紬ちゃんが\n私と同じことを考えていたなんてね。","zh":"……呵呵♪　真没想到，紬\n居然和我想到一块儿去了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dab952ab58087e5f4ab8220cc44e5e0557b5a66acd8851343b1b106be5bdb265","ja":"同じことって……もしかして、桜守さんもですか？","zh":"同样的事……难道说，樱守小姐也是吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e15e2f87faf59bfc4fab86478523d74769693bbc89028e64080b0d622823e160","ja":"ええ。私も紬ちゃんみたいにエレガントに\n振舞わなきゃって思って、すごく緊張しちゃってたの。","zh":"嗯。我当时心想自己也得像紬一样举止优雅才行，\n结果就变得特别紧张。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0e6b33e49608053b777a02542270ffc84ef0cdc117692fbd675fd9a4a025edb2","ja":"で、ですが、桜守さんこそ、\nスタッフの方に褒められてましたのに……？","zh":"但、但是，明明樱守小姐才更受\n工作人员的称赞呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2f3db983c5e5a6b0f79504ecd80bc1ab0713a5ba8fcef50ed081363493b40932","ja":"言われてみればそうだったかも。緊張しすぎてて、\nその時は頭に入ってこなかったみたいね。","zh":"经你这么一说好像确实是那样。当时太紧张了，\n看来完全没听进去呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f702802f2ebfad3b7f77f9215472bbd91dea89643126e77f1fb985d3d1a96501","ja":"……それではお互い、今日の撮影は\nうまくいったのですね。安心いたしました。","zh":"……这么说来，我们双方今天的拍摄\n都挺顺利呢。这下我就放心了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9ce1f048185f4f9a9b28264b8e7934fd897a7d91888651a082b8d4bd00e2996e","ja":"私もよ。……ふぅ～、なんだかほっとしたら、\nお腹が空いてきちゃったみたい。","zh":"我也是。……呼～，总觉得一放下心来，\n肚子好像就饿了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1a55e42fdcc18207c1cb55c956fdbfb9742416e354443491a1b7493c21985e3c","ja":"それなら、もしよろしければ、\nこの近くの甘味処に寄っていきませんか？","zh":"既然这样，如果您不介意的话，\n要不要顺便去这附近的甜品店坐坐？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2b1a31d9c1aef4c5103c72776de5f9001f2556210845f6f13624084ea1ab177a","ja":"ええ、もちろん！\n今ならリラックスして、楽しく味わえそうね♪","zh":"好啊，当然没问题！\n现在的话应该能放松下来，好好享受了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
